Data sources (web hook parity, bound through ChargingListDataSource → ADR-004, no networking
in the view):
  useChargingSessionsPaginated -> loadSessions(vehicleID, range) -> GET /charging [vehicle_id,start,end,limit,offset]
  useChargingOptimizer         -> loadOptimizer(vehicleID)       -> GET /analytics/charging-optimizer [vehicle_id]
  useBulkDeleteCharging        -> bulkDelete(ids)                -> DELETE /charging/bulk
SI discipline (ADR-005): sessions are kept SI-canonical exactly as the API delivers — energy
  in watt-hours (energyAddedWh), power in watts (peakPowerW/avgPowerW), cost decimal. kWh / kW
  are derived ONLY at the render boundary by ChargingListFormat (energyKwh = Wh/1000,
  powerKw = W/1000); the cost cards apply the user's currency symbol there. Nothing non-SI is
  stored or computed in the model/aggregation.

